0..75 Comment "// A model of an extension where a model of the theory it includes is asked"
76..147 Comment "// : each theory a block includes, directly or through another, takes a"
148..227 Comment "// reduct, `Monoid.Semigroup` from `Model(Monoid)` to `Model(Semigroup)`, which"
228..307 Comment "// keeps the members the inclusion places and forgets the rest; a sort is kept,"
308..381 Comment "// never sealed. The checker applies it where the one model stands at the"
382..455 Comment "// other, and the run and the kernel read the application. A model of the"
456..533 Comment "// extension with its carrier manifest stands there too, by the map that puts"
534..573 Comment "// the carrier back and then restricts."
574..576 Comment "//"
577..592 Comment "// - see: #1092"
593..608 Comment "// - see: #2136"
610..685 Comment "// The semigroup, the monoid, both extensions at once, and the endomorphism"
686..696 Comment "// monoid."
